-- Starter names for Swiper. Idempotent: safe to run repeatedly.
-- NOTE: "popularity" is a rough relative score from 1 to 100 (about 95+ = very
-- common in the UK/US, 50 = mid-popular, below 20 = rare). It is an estimate
-- for ranking and variety only, not a birth count.
-- Meanings are short and plain; "Meaning uncertain" is used where the etymology
-- is disputed or unclear. is_starter = true marks the diverse first deck.
-- Requires the is_starter column (added by the supabase/migrations files).

on conflict (name, gender) do update set
  origins = excluded.origins,
  meaning = excluded.meaning,
  style_tags = excluded.style_tags,
  syllables = excluded.syllables,
  popularity = excluded.popularity,
  blurb = excluded.blurb,
  is_starter = excluded.is_starter;
